{"question_id": "R-020", "question": "주택 구입을 위해 IRP 적립금을 중도인출할 수 있나요?", "answer": "[답변]\n네, 무주택자인 가입자가 본인 명의로 주택을 구입하는 경우 개인형 퇴직연금제도(IRP)의 적립금을 중도인출할 수 있습니다.\n\n[근거]\n- [출처: docs_renamed/doc14.pdf, 2페이지, ef05c9c97fbadd27-paragraph_group-c169d907b699]\n- [출처: docs_renamed/doc14.pdf, 2페이지, ef05c9c97fbadd27-table-df471ef8e98c]", "answer_hash": "8df656a1d015ffb9b7409567e06e98cc7bfb6aa8e6c17da6a3ab751e9b596239", "route": "simple", "evidence_sufficient": true, "generator_attempted": true, "generator_called": true, "citation_valid": true, "cited_chunk_ids": ["ef05c9c97fbadd27-paragraph_group-c169d907b699", "ef05c9c97fbadd27-table-df471ef8e98c"], "selected_merged_evidence_ids": ["ef05c9c97fbadd27-paragraph_group-c169d907b699", "ef05c9c97fbadd27-paragraph_group-789430c51fb1", "ef05c9c97fbadd27-paragraph_group-98497575ff11", "61c5315b1e7c0f25-paragraph_group-46bf80f2eb31", "49ed30e0f7b42e68-paragraph_group-9dd9842bb428", "ef05c9c97fbadd27-table-df471ef8e98c", "4607500e74afcdf8-paragraph_group-fd0d4e7d80e6", "4607500e74afcdf8-table-6f164502cbce", "e8d7e6a69504e042-table-e07c4f8c5781", "ae713c70a631594f-paragraph_group-3f366b654f2b"], "semantic_correctness": "pending_manual_review", "requirement_coverage": "pending_manual_review", "grounding": "pending_manual_review", "answer_relevance": "pending_manual_review", "hallucination": "pending_manual_review", "information_limit_handling": "pending_manual_review"}
